1070:    * The given function is executed immediately.
1071:    * <p>
1072:    * This method should only be used when converting a promise to another type.
1073:    * See {@link #apply(Function)} for applying custom promise operators.
1074:    *
1075:    * @param function the promise conversion function
1076:    * @param <O> the type the promise will be converted to
