743:    * Transforms a failure of the given type (potentially into a value) by applying the given function to it.
744:    * <p>
745:    * This method is similar to {@link #mapError(Function)}, except that it allows async transformation.
746:    *
747:    * @param function the transformation to apply to the promise failure
748:    * @return a promise
749:    * @since 1.3
750:    */
